s-&gt;&gt;&gt;cc : Move gym to tomorrow 7am
cc-&gt;&gt;&gt;f : chat(sessionId, text)
f-&gt;&gt;&gt;ag : handle(session, text)
ref=ag tr : nextAction - the LLM chooses resolve_date (SD04)
ag-&gt;&gt;&gt;tr : execute(call, context)
tr-&gt;&gt;&gt;rd : execute(call, context)
rd-&gt;&gt;&gt;rd + : validate(args)
rd-&gt;&gt;&gt;rd + : doExecute(args, context)
rd-&gt;&gt;&gt;dr : resolve("tomorrow 7am", now)
dr.&gt;rd : 2026-10-13 07h00
rd.&gt;tr : ToolResult success
tr.&gt;ag : ToolResult
ref=ag tr : nextAction - get_calendar finds block b42 Gym
ag-&gt;&gt;&gt;tr : execute(call, context)
tr-&gt;&gt;&gt;ep : execute(call, context)
ep-&gt;&gt;&gt;ep + : validate(args)
combinedFragment=alt~a1 ag cd
ag:[arguments valid]
ep-&gt;&gt;&gt;ep + : doExecute(args, context)
ep-&gt;&gt;&gt;pcf : fromOperation(operation, workspace)
pcf.&gt;ep : MoveBlockCommand
ep-&gt;&gt;&gt;ws : snapshot()
ws.&gt;ep : copy
ep-&gt;&gt;&gt;cd : detect(snapshot, range, constraints)
cd.&gt;ep : conflicts, none
ep.&gt;tr : ToolResult success with PlanProposal
tr.&gt;ag : ToolResult
ag.&gt;f : AgentResponse PROPOSAL_READY
f.&gt;cc : AgentResponse
ref=s cc : SD08 - apply the proposal, SD14 - undo
..=a1
ag:[blockId missing or invalid]
ep.&gt;tr : ToolResult failure, blockId is required
tr.&gt;ag : error observation, the tool never ran
ag-&gt;&gt;&gt;ag + : observe(session, result)
ref=ag ep : next step - LLM corrects the call or asks which block
